From: Lume Retro OS
Subject: [PATCH] intl: label "Quit" as "Shut Down" (en, pt_BR, es)

On Lume Retro OS, quitting RetroArch powers the console off (r36os-session),
so the menu item says so. Only the languages the system ships messages for
are changed; the others keep the upstream text.

--- a/intl/msg_hash_us.h
+++ b/intl/msg_hash_us.h
@@ -211,11 +211,11 @@
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_LABEL_VALUE_QUIT_RETROARCH,
-   "Quit"
+   "Shut Down"
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_SUBLABEL_QUIT_RETROARCH,
-   "Quit RetroArch application. Configuration save on exit is enabled."
+   "Save pending data and turn off the console."
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_LABEL_VALUE_CLOUD_SYNC_SYNC_NOW,
--- a/intl/msg_hash_pt_br.h
+++ b/intl/msg_hash_pt_br.h
@@ -203,11 +203,11 @@
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_LABEL_VALUE_QUIT_RETROARCH,
-   "Sair"
+   "Desligar"
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_SUBLABEL_QUIT_RETROARCH,
-   "Fecha o RetroArch.\n\"Salvar configuração ao sair\" está ativado."
+   "Grava o que estiver pendente e desliga o console."
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_LABEL_VALUE_CLOUD_SYNC_SYNC_NOW,
--- a/intl/msg_hash_es.h
+++ b/intl/msg_hash_es.h
@@ -211,11 +211,11 @@
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_LABEL_VALUE_QUIT_RETROARCH,
-   "Cerrar RetroArch"
+   "Apagar"
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_SUBLABEL_QUIT_RETROARCH,
-   "Abandona la aplicación RetroArch. La opción «Guardar configuración al salir» está activada."
+   "Guarda lo pendiente y apaga la consola."
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_LABEL_VALUE_CLOUD_SYNC_SYNC_NOW,
